ectly *nobody has listed this file*. Still unproven: **no human has picked a file in a browser** — the end-to-end proof ran against a throwaway root (own database, own `arcade/`) with the **real** catalogue and a real 4 MB file (§8.9 item 0a), and nothing has been added to the **live** shelf this way |
